{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "b",
  "task": "t120",
  "chunk": "b/051",
  "family": "WAR20"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u17074",
   "en": "Well then whatever it is, we can't let him have it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17075",
   "en": "Then whatever it is, we cannot let him have it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17076",
   "en": "Then whatever it is, we can't let him have it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17077",
   "en": "You have the Cipher. In time, your visions will clear. They will lead you to the Conduit. I only pray you find it before Saren does.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17078",
   "en": "When the creature enveloped me, I became part of it. But I still don't truly understand it. So alien. So ancient.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17079",
   "en": "Its exact age is impossible to know. It measured time differently. Ten thousand years of hibernation broken by a few frantic centuries of activity.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17080",
   "en": "Its mind was awesome. Magnificent. It transcended all classification. And now it is gone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17081",
   "en": "The Thorian was a unique life-form -- a sentient being that lived for 50,000 years, maybe more. There is nothing even remotely like it in the known galaxy. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17082",
   "en": "I am grateful you saved me from a life of thralldom. Yet I cannot help but feel some sorrow for the loss of such a rare and remarkable creature.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17083",
   "en": "There is nothing remarkable about me. I was merely one of Matriarch Benezia's disciples. For nearly two centuries, I followed her, learning at her feet.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17084",
   "en": "When Benezia revealed her plan to join Saren, she gave her disciples a choice. Only those who were willing had to follow her. Many felt her plan was too dangerous.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17085",
   "en": "But I believed in her. I thought she could turn Saren away from his insanity. Instead, we joined him in it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17086",
   "en": "You said Saren uses it to manipulate his followers.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17087",
   "en": "Instead, she became one of his most powerful allies.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17088",
   "en": "Do you know what the Conduit is? Or where it is?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17089",
   "en": "The galaxy's a better place with that thing dead and gone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17090",
   "en": "Don't tell me you feel sorry for that thing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17091",
   "en": "Don't worry. I'll be fine.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17092",
   "en": "The Conduit",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17093",
   "en": "It controls minds?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17094",
   "en": "It backfired.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17095",
   "en": "It was an abomination!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17096",
   "en": "You sound almost sad.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17097",
   "en": "Benezia foresaw the influence Saren would have. She joined him to guide him down a gentler path. But Saren is compelling. Benezia lost her way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17098",
   "en": "After Saren had what he needed, the Thorian became a liability.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17099",
   "en": "I was a willing slave when Saren brought me to this world. He needed my biotics to communicate with the Thorian, to learn its secrets.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17100",
   "en": "I'm here to make a deal.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17101",
   "en": "He tricked her?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17102",
   "en": "How is this possible?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17103",
   "en": "What does it do?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17104",
   "en": "Try to relax, Commander. Slow, deep breaths. Let go of your physical shell. Reach out to grasp the threads that bind us, one to another.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17105",
   "en": "Every action sends ripples across the galaxy. Every idea must touch another mind to live. Each emotion must mark another's spirit.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17106",
   "en": "Embrace eternity!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17107",
   "en": "I need that knowledge to stop Saren!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17108",
   "en": "You taught Saren. You can teach me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17109",
   "en": "I need the Cipher.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17110",
   "en": "There has to be some way!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17111",
   "en": "You gave it to Saren.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17112",
   "en": "We are all connected. Every living being united in a single, glorious existence. Open yourself to the universe, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR30_02I_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17113",
   "en": "It just can't get worse than this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17114",
   "en": "Feros could have been great if we'd had the support we asked for.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17115",
   "en": "We don't even know where the geth came from.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17116",
   "en": "We fought hard for this colony.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17117",
   "en": "We'll start over. What else can we do?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17118",
   "en": "ExoGeni has obligations here. Hopefully they learned their lesson.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17119",
   "en": "We've never had funding like this before.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17120",
   "en": "You really forced ExoGeni to see our potential.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17121",
   "en": "I'm taking the money and running.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17122",
   "en": "I'll keep my mouth shut, that's for sure.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17123",
   "en": "They wiped out our defenses in minutes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17124",
   "en": "This wouldn't have happened if ExoGeni had backed us from the start.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17125",
   "en": "Those geth never gave us a chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17126",
   "en": "We fought hard for this colony, but we're not soldiers.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17127",
   "en": "I hope ExoGeni knows enough to stay out of our way now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17128",
   "en": "It's nice to finally get the support we deserve.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17129",
   "en": "I never thought we'd get this much support from the home office.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17130",
   "en": "Could be worse things than a bribe.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17131",
   "en": "I'll keep my mouth shut. I really don't like the alternative.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17132",
   "en": "How are we supposed to fight an enemy like this?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17133",
   "en": "If only ExoGeni had supported us from the start.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17134",
   "en": "I hope you fare better against the geth.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17135",
   "en": "The frontier is a lot more dangerous than we were told.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17136",
   "en": "I hope ExoGeni learned their lesson.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17137",
   "en": "Colonial Affairs is going to hear about this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17138",
   "en": "It looks like the colony will survive after all.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17139",
   "en": "This is great. We'll have more than enough to make it work this time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17140",
   "en": "This is a huge loss. We could have made something of this place.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17141",
   "en": "I'm taking whatever I can get and never looking back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17142",
   "en": "We've been trapped for days.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17143",
   "en": "ExoGeni could have prevented all this in the first place.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17144",
   "en": "It was over in hours. The geth crushed us completely.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17145",
   "en": "There's not much you can do when a force like that shows up on your doorstep.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17146",
   "en": "I hope everyone just leaves us in peace now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17147",
   "en": "ExoGeni better come through or this will be all over Colonial Affairs.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17148",
   "en": "All of a sudden, it's like we're worth something.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17149",
   "en": "I'll take the money. I don't like it, but I'll take it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17150",
   "en": "It beats dying, I guess.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17151",
   "en": "I hope you can get us out of this mess.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17152",
   "en": "If ExoGeni had just put in a bit more support from the start....",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17153",
   "en": "This place is a lot worse than I expected.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17154",
   "en": "Feros can work. It just needs help.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17155",
   "en": "ExoGeni better fund us like they agreed to in the first place.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17156",
   "en": "It's about time someone gave that ExoGeni stooge what he deserved.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17157",
   "en": "You sure get results.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17158",
   "en": "I don't know how you convinced them to reinvest, but thank you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17159",
   "en": "I'm getting out while I can.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17160",
   "en": "Time to get the hell out of here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17161",
   "en": "If I survive this, I'm going back to Earth.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17162",
   "en": "We asked for help in the beginning, but they didn't listen.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17163",
   "en": "I don't know if the colony can survive this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17164",
   "en": "We tried to fight on our own, but the geth were too much.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17165",
   "en": "We'll make it. It'll be rough, but we'll make it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17166",
   "en": "We can do this. We just need the chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17167",
   "en": "I've never seen such a turnaround by a company.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17168",
   "en": "It's time to leave this all behind.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17169",
   "en": "I've never seen a colony fold so fast.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17170",
   "en": "We ran when the attack hit.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17171",
   "en": "I don't think any of the colonies get the support they deserve.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17172",
   "en": "The geth just blindsided us. We never stood a chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17173",
   "en": "Every colony deserves a chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17174",
   "en": "Hopefully, everyone leaves us alone for awhile.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17175",
   "en": "Maybe the home office will get off their asses and help us now. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17176",
   "en": "Huh. I hope the new money doesn't spoil this place.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17177",
   "en": "It will be interesting to see what Feros looks like in a year.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17178",
   "en": "I guess taking the easy way out is our only choice.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17179",
   "en": "I'll take the deal, but it leaves a bad taste in my mouth.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17180",
   "en": "Why build a colony if you don't intend to defend it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17181",
   "en": "You'd think ExoGeni would be more interested in protecting their investment.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17182",
   "en": "I'll be glad when this is all over.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17183",
   "en": "We're not soldiers. We didn't stand a chance against the geth.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17184",
   "en": "I hope ExoGeni learned from this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17185",
   "en": "Colonial Affairs needs to rein in companies like ExoGeni.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17186",
   "en": "You won't recognize this place when we're done.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17187",
   "en": "I'm leaving as soon as possible.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17188",
   "en": "I don't need to be told twice. I'm taking my credits and running.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17189",
   "en": "Any luck finding my workstation out in the ruins?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17190",
   "en": "That's very good news, indeed. Thank you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17191",
   "en": "Plans for a few prototype mods.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17192",
   "en": "I'm a freelancer. Some of my mods are highly sought after.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17193",
   "en": "Maybe I've got a bit of the frontier spirit in me. That, and the alternative is a bit too \"secure\" for my liking.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17194",
   "en": "Freelancers don't have to worry about security as much, so long as we keep a low profile.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17195",
   "en": "Ah, that's for smarter men than me to figure out. I have no idea what anyone would want with this ruin.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17196",
   "en": "Just keep in mind what I said.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17197",
   "en": "Thanks again. That data will be very valuable, once I get out of here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17198",
   "en": "Hmm... they could survive out there, no problem.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17199",
   "en": "Yeah, they could find it, no problem.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17200",
   "en": "I wonder if I should ask for their help.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17201",
   "en": "What's the harm in asking? As long as it doesn't get in their way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17202",
   "en": "I was hoping you'd have a moment to speak with me. I've got a bit of a problem.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17203",
   "en": "I understand. Just hear me out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17204",
   "en": "I need to retrieve some data. It's not a big job, but it pays well.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17205",
   "en": "Good. I don't want to get myself killed before I can leave this place.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17206",
   "en": "Good, good. Poking around in the ruins has become a bit too dangerous for me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17207",
   "en": "All right. Just remember there's money to be made if you want it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17208",
   "en": "What is it about you that makes people assume we enjoy being in harm's way?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17209",
   "en": "It's not that bad, really.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17210",
   "en": "All you need to do is find my console at ExoGeni headquarters and drop the data onto this OSD. It's that simple.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17211",
   "en": "I appreciate it. That data could be worth a lot of money.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17212",
   "en": "Of course, this all depends on getting out of here alive.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17213",
   "en": "After this disaster I could use a little good news. A few credits to get me started again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17214",
   "en": "Just come and see me when you've got the data.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17215",
   "en": "Have you seen anyone else heading to ExoGeni lately?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17216",
   "en": "Well, that's very comforting. Certain death for some, fine for us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17217",
   "en": "Deadly for him, fine for us. What could be better?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17218",
   "en": "People are quick to assume we enjoy being in hazardous situations.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17219",
   "en": "Why do people always assume we enjoy putting ourselves in harm's way?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17220",
   "en": "I managed to find the data and transfer it to your OSD.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17221",
   "en": "Tell me about the data I'm getting for you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17222",
   "en": "Why work in the middle of nowhere if your skills are so useful?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17223",
   "en": "Do you have any idea what the geth were looking for?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
